WEBVTT

00:07:59.642 --> 00:08:04.021
Sort of, wacky people trying something new
just to see if it'll work.

00:08:04.021 --> 00:08:06.065
And at first, Facebook was fun, remember?

00:08:06.106 --> 00:08:09.735
We got hot dates and we found lost dogs,

00:08:09.777 --> 00:08:14.156
and college reunions became
totally obsolete, which was awesome.

00:08:14.198 --> 00:08:16.325
(Laughter)

00:08:16.951 --> 00:08:18.661
A few people made a lot of money,

00:08:18.702 --> 00:08:21.038
and the rest of us
were a little bit better off.

00:08:21.455 --> 00:08:24.833
But, flash forward 14 or 15 years,

00:08:24.875 --> 00:08:29.380
and Facebook is being called repeatedly
to the congressional carpet

00:08:29.421 --> 00:08:33.050
to answer for, actually,
all the sins of big tech.